            "caption": "Sshd Logfile: Aborted Connections Warning",
            "description": "Number of connections that ended before authentication within `--lookback` that returns WARNING. Every host answering on the SSH port collects these all day, so this is meant to catch a scan starting and not the background noise. 0 turns the threshold off. Example: `--aborted-connections-warning=500`.",
            "datatype": "Icinga\\Module\\Director\\DataType\\DataTypeString",
